  "body": "Set within the very popular Kensington Park development, this is an immaculately presented, contemporary apartment with a northerly aspect that ensures plenty of sunshine, natural light and warmth.\r\n\r\nThe lovely, open plan living/dining area is the central hub of the apartment. It is a warm bright space that perfectly flows out onto the deck which is great for summer BBQ's and entertaining. The modern kitchen has Smeg appliances and induction hob with tons of storage. There are two large, sunny bedrooms including the master with an ensuite and a large family bathroom. There are two car parks in the secure underground car park.\r\n\r\nKensington Park is spread across around 17 hectares and is just a short, flat walk - approximately 500 to 450 m from the white sands of Orewa Beach and the vibrant Orewa town centre . Within the development you'll gain access to the heated indoor pool, fully equipped gym, sauna, putting green, pétanque courts, community gardens, playgrounds, picnic areas, and lakeside tranquility.\r\n\r\nCall now for a private viewing or I'll see you at one of the Open Homes.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
